 "class_rule": "Classes per circuit cell on R_i = X_i / X_0 (gate_H0_ddtest.ratio_interval, Poisson 95 %): COLLAPSED iff R_hi95 < 0.25; INTACT iff R_lo95 > 1; INTERMEDIATE otherwise.  If X_i <= 0 (no excess reference hits) the interval is [0, U_i / L_0] with U_i = the Garwood 97.5 % upper limit of the cell's pooled reference count minus its garbage expectation and L_0 = the Garwood 2.5 % lower limit of T0's count minus T0's garbage expectation (executor addition fixed before data: the ratio_interval of gate_H0_ddtest is undefined there).",
